    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, we have a massive problem. That memo about the community center funding vote just leaked to the press. It's looking bad because people are starting to say the candidate doesn't care about the neighborhood. If the reporters ask why they voted 'no' on that bill, what's our move? I need a response that keeps our favorability numbers from tanking.",
